    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Jev reads the WhatsApp chat on screen only when you tap the bubble. The messages it read, with the scene you chose, go to OpenRouter and from there to the model providers (TypeSafe for Jev, DeepSeek for drafting). Jev keeps no chat text, contact names or replies on the phone. It stores your encrypted key, these settings, the scene you picked for each chat (under a salted hash, never the name), and a diagnostic log of counts, scores and timings with no chat text, which leaves the phone only if you share it. It never sends a message for you: Fill only puts the reply in the message box, and you press send.</string>
